{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2023-03-13 16:30:00', 'title': 'FMC CORPORATION ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT OF CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER DR. KAREN TOTLAND, TO BE SUCCEEDED BY JULIE DINATALE IN JULY', 'text': "PHILADELPHIA , MARCH 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FMC CORPORATION (NYSE: FMC) HAS ANNOUNCED THE RETIREMENT OF DR. KAREN TOTLAND, VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER (CSO), FOLLOWING A NEARLY 30-YEAR CAREER IN THE SPECIALTY CHEMICAL INDUSTRY. JULIE DINATALE, DIRECTOR OF TRUTERRA SUSTAINABILITY PARTNERSHIPS, A DIVISION OF LAND O'LAKES, WILL SUCCEED TOTLAND AS VICE PRESIDENT AND CSO ON JULY 1, 2023."}